{
  "rationale": "Use a small sensor plant plus a motion-capability plant, then encode the exploration and obstacle-recovery policy in compact deterministic specifications. The policy gives strong forward bias in clear space, uses short directed turns for side/front obstacles, allows rare brief backward escape only from a dedicated front-recovery state, and reserves full_rotate for a dedicated last-resort stuck state after repeated front blockage.",
  "strategy": [
    "Separate sensing and actuation into plant automata, with obstacle/path events uncontrollable and motion commands controllable",
    "Use one policy specification for clear-space exploration and one-shot recovery states, plus a small anti-repetition specification to prevent endless turning/random-walk loops and to force a forward attempt after reorientation"
  ],
